#. FabricateItNow.STRINGS.MOD_DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "FabricateItNow.STRINGS.MOD_DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Eliminates the delay and allows Duplicants to immediately start recipe fabrication immediately after the ingredients are delivered."
